{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>深圳被「養貴」網民稱寧願留港消費　北上還值不值？網民推薦超抵項目｜網絡熱話</strong></p><p>・標題聚焦北上消費取捨<br>・內容欄未提供報道正文<br>・無法核實北上成本<br>・無法判斷網民建議<br>・只能按現有資訊評估</p><p>暫時未能從TVB 新聞擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1201923-深圳被養貴網民稱寧願留港消費北上還值不值網民推薦超抵項目網絡熱話\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T23:59:39.946770+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"minimal","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T23:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T23:58:03.067740+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T23:58:03.067740+00:00","content_hash":"99ba7194fb6247c965c43698e68b348a030906e8911a51d97b8bf4f1c2bfdf1a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}